    <briefdescription>
<para>Computes structured, field-level diffs between project snapshots. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All diff operations return a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1projects_1_1_delta_set" kindref="compound">DeltaSet</ref></computeroutput> — never a raw text diff. The comparison is performed at document-metadata level: each <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1projects_1_1_document_meta" kindref="compound">DocumentMeta</ref></computeroutput> field is compared independently, and missing documents appear as ADDED / REMOVED top-level entries.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1projects_1_1_project_diff" kindref="compound">ProjectDiff</ref></computeroutput> is stateless and all methods are thread-safe. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
